---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import SceneWindow from '../components/SceneWindow.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/ui/CTASection.astro';
import {pageMetadata} from '../data/metadata';
---
<MainLayout {...pageMetadata.about}>
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR LOCAL BUSINESS.</span><h1>You take pride in your work.<br />Your website should show it.</h1><p>You repair the heat, care for the yard, or open the shop each morning. We help customers see what you offer, trust what you do, and know how to reach you.</p><div class="actions"><Button href="/contact/">Tell us about your business <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></Button></div></div><SceneWindow/></div></section>
  <Section><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHY HOMETOWN BOOST EXISTS.</span><h2 style="margin-top:22px">Run your business.<br />We’ll handle the website.</h2></div><div><p>Your time belongs with your customers. Designing pages, managing hosting, and keeping business information current shouldn’t take over your day.</p><p>Hometown Boost brings that work together in a monthly plan: a professional website, hosting and maintenance, and local visibility support at your chosen level.</p><p>There’s no setup fee. The build and ongoing support are spread across your plan’s minimum term, with the price, scope, and commitment clear before you start.</p></div></div></Section>
  <Section variant="light" eyebrow="WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT." title="Clear answers. Useful work. Ongoing care.">
    <div class="grid grid--3"><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">01 / PLAIN SPOKEN</span><h3>Answers you can use.</h3><p>We explain the work, what’s included, and what comes next. You should understand what you’re paying for.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">02 / CUSTOMER FOCUSED</span><h3>Built around your customers.</h3><p>Clear services, a defined service area, and the photos, reviews, or credentials that help customers choose your business.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">03 / HERE FOR THE UPKEEP</span><h3>Support beyond launch day.</h3><p>As your business changes, your website should keep up. Hosting, maintenance, and plan-based content updates are part of the service.</p></article></div>
  </Section>
  <Section><div class="split"><div><span class="eyebrow">KNOW WHAT YOU’RE BUYING.</span><h2 style="margin-top:20px">Clear scope.<br />A plan that fits.</h2></div><div><p>We recommend a plan around your services, the pages you need, and the level of ongoing help that makes sense for your business.</p><p>Our prices and minimum terms are public, and extra work is scoped before it starts. We build for clear information and easy contact; search rankings, lead counts, and revenue are not guaranteed.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/" style="margin-top:20px">Compare plans and pricing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></Section>
  <CTASection/>
</MainLayout>
